stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: A replica is only part of Regional recovery
accDescr: The secondary receives asynchronous storage replication before failure. Recovery must promote it, reconnect application clients and redirect traffic before service is restored.
[*] --> Replicating
Replicating: Primary writes, secondary receives changes
Replicating --> Detect: Primary Region unavailable
Detect: Detect outage and evaluate replica lag
Detect --> Promote
Promote: Fail over to prepared secondary
Promote --> Reconnect
Reconnect: Reconnect application to writable database
Reconnect --> Verify
Verify: Redirect traffic and verify service
Verify --> [*]
note right of Detect
 RPO depends on lag at failure
end note
note right of Verify
 RTO includes the entire recovery path
end note
